1. Hydration Mismatches (Most Common Next.js Error)
Problem: "Text content does not match server-rendered HTML"
Root Causes:

* Date/time rendering differently on server vs client
* Browser-only APIs used during SSR
* Random values or user-specific content
* Third-party scripts modifying DOM

